{
  "rationale": "Use a small plant split into sensing and motion capability, then a single deterministic policy specification that maps clear sensing to exploratory motion and obstacle sensing to one-shot turn recovery. The specification is total on uncontrollable events in every state, keeps exactly one controllable enabled per nonterminal policy state, avoids forward motion under front blockage, prefers random_walk in clear exploration, uses short directed turns for ordinary recovery, and returns quickly to exploration when path_clear is observed.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant sensing from motion capability so the supervisor can constrain actions without inventing new events",
    "Use one clear exploration state with random_walk, one short forward-progress state with move_forward, and dedicated obstacle recovery states with exactly one turn action each"
  ],
